          "short": "$2\\frac{1}{15}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4a-b&=4\\times\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\4a-b&=\\frac{8}{3}-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\4a-b&=\\frac{40}{15}-\\frac{9}{15}\\\\4a-b&=\\frac{31}{15}=2\\frac{1}{15}\\end{align*}$$",
